-          "quote": "Input a model of [[def-trust-region-quadratic-model-and-ratio]] with gradient\n$g$, symmetric model matrix $B$, and\nradius $\\Delta>0$. If $g=0$, return $p_C=0$ with status `stationary`. If\n$g\\ne0$, set $c:=g^TBg$ and define\n$$\\tau:=\\begin{cases}\n\\Delta/\\|g\\|_2,&c\\le0,\\\\\n\\min\\{\\|g\\|_2^2/c,\\ \\Delta/\\|g\\|_2\\},&c>0.\n\\end{cases}$$\nReturn $p_C:=-\\tau g$ with status `step`. The procedure uses no matrix\nfactorization and has no iteration loop.",
